{"type":"message","id":"37eee54c","parentId":"7affef20","timestamp":"2026-03-13T12:02:15.665Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户问能不能关闭技能，等正式环境再启动，我已经执行了mv命令把技能目录改成了.disabled后缀，现在技能已经被禁用了，因为OpenClaw只会加载符合规范的技能目录，带.disabled后缀的不会被识别。接下来回复用户就行，说明已经关闭了，之后要启用的时候直接把后缀改回来就行。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 飞书对话辅助技能已临时关闭！\n现在不会再自动触发卡片发送、流式输出等相关逻辑，恢复到默认的纯文本消息模式。\n\n后续上线正式环境需要启用时，只需要执行：\n```bash\nmv ~/.openclaw/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-conversation-helper.disabled ~/.openclaw/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-conversation-helper\n```\n即可重新激活所有功能。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773403322858}}
